So ever since I started going to therapy,

00:18:16.610 --> 00:18:18.253
a couple of years ago,

00:18:20.020 --> 00:18:23.290
one of the things that my
therapist does on a regular basis,

00:18:23.290 --> 00:18:24.660
is take solo trips.

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:28.923
Like, he'll go take like a,

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:31.860
he can do like twice a year.

00:18:31.860 --> 00:18:34.690
He'll do over a week long trip.

00:18:34.690 --> 00:18:35.950
Well that's a sabbatical.

00:18:35.950 --> 00:18:39.160
If you go over a week
you're taking a sabbatical.

00:18:39.160 --> 00:18:40.510
He's always talked about,

00:18:40.510 --> 00:18:44.883
and I've known lot's of friends who,

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:48.210
