00:19:03.040 --> 00:19:08.040
And again, he's just like,
it's just a different vibe.

00:19:08.520 --> 00:19:11.470
Especially when you are,
you've never done it before.

00:19:11.470 --> 00:19:14.670
And each person has their own reasons

00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:16.580
why they would want to do it,

00:19:16.580 --> 00:19:20.010
and what might be the benefits of it.

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:21.167
But he's just talked
about, he's just like,

00:19:21.167 --> 00:19:24.247
"You unplug and you kind
of have an intention,

00:19:24.247 --> 00:19:25.877
"and you just get out there

00:19:25.877 --> 00:19:30.050
"and you don't really know
exactly what's going to happen."

00:19:30.050 --> 00:19:30.883
But he's just like,

00:19:30.883 --> 00:19:32.730
at this point I couldn't do without them.

00:19:32.730 --> 00:19:34.917
They are like my reset button, right?

00:19:34.917 --> 00:19:36.350
And you hear people talk about this.

00:19:36.350 --> 00:19:39.460
Like, I don't know if
it's an urban legend,

00:19:39.460 --> 00:19:43.950
but like Rivers Cuomo goes
off for a month every year

00:19:43.950 --> 00:19:46.700
into a silent, he does
like a silent retreat.

