I went to Slab City and
interacted with people.

00:21:18.964 --> 00:21:21.233
I was alone a lot, but not the whole time.

00:21:21.233 --> 00:21:23.360
To clarify, I'm not
necessarily going to be

00:21:23.360 --> 00:21:25.610
