that might be the case.

00:22:01.190 --> 00:22:04.240
So one of the things that my
therapist has talked about,

00:22:04.240 --> 00:22:05.073
and this is, I mean,

00:22:05.073 --> 00:22:09.170
this is not exclusive
knowledge that he has.

00:22:09.170 --> 00:22:11.250
