00:36:33.800 --> 00:36:35.393
So it's a toilet in a shower.

00:36:35.393 --> 00:36:37.056
Well I shit in the shower already

00:36:37.056 --> 00:36:39.517
Sign me up.

00:36:39.517 --> 00:36:44.200
It's a shower with a grateless drain.

00:36:44.200 --> 00:36:45.033
Wow.

00:36:45.033 --> 00:36:46.117
No, you just, you put the lid down

00:36:46.117 --> 00:36:48.119
