00:36:48.119 --> 00:36:50.390
or like, I dunno, I guess hover.

00:36:50.390 --> 00:36:51.480
Where does it go though?

00:36:51.480 --> 00:36:53.640
Where does the feces go?

00:36:53.640 --> 00:36:58.200
Onto the highway. No, it
goes into a container.

00:36:58.200 --> 00:37:00.370
Yeah, and then you take that
container around with you

00:37:00.370 --> 00:37:01.630
